    "final": "Found 2 current junior-level Data Analyst positions in New York for your saved resume:\n\n**Sources:**\n- LinkedIn: blocked - sign-in required, could not search without login\n- Indeed: accessible - searched `junior data analyst` in New York, NY, verified 2 postings\n\n**1. Data Analyst - GoodApple - New York, NY**\n- URL: https://www.indeed.com/jobs?l=New+York%2C+NY&q=junior+data+analyst&vjk=2233e7ae15e45957\n- Seniority fit: 0-2 years marketing or analytics experience requested - fits junior\n- Score: 43.45 / completed\n- Matched: Python experience (preferred)\n- Gaps: advanced SQL + pipelines/data architecture, client-facing dashboards/reports, excellent communication/presenting to clients\n- Caveats: In-person 4 days/week Monday-Thursday in NYC office; must be legally authorized to work in US, no visa sponsorship\n\n**2. Associate Data Analyst - Research Foundation of The City University of New York - New York, NY 10007**\n- URL: https://www.indeed.com/jobs?l=New+York%2C+NY&q=junior+data+analyst&vjk=33cd00bb496b557e\n- Seniority fit: Associate level, 1 year data management preferred, bachelor's required - fits junior\n- Score: 47.05 / completed\n- Matched: bachelor's degree (required), basic Python/R/SQL as a plus (preferred)\n- Gaps: cross-functional collaboration/stakeholder response, strong interpersonal skills, advanced Microsoft 365 / Excel / PowerPoint, energy-efficiency domain familiarity\n- Caveats: Hybrid on-site 3 days/week at 1 Centre St, NYC residency may be required; immigration sponsorship not available\n\nBoth scores are below a strong match (43-47), so I am not recommending them as strong fits - disclosing per your seniority and verification request rather than filling a quota. No applications made, no schedule created.",
